<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Apps and web applications are accessed from thousands of device-browser-platform combinations simultaneously. Needless to say, teams need to develop robust applications that run flawlessly across the most widely used combinations. However, given the increasing number of mobile devices already present in the market \(plus new ones being released\), it is challenging to test applications on every latest mobile device rolled out. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [9]
>>
