/ActualText (1.Software testing has evolved significantly from its early days when it was often an afterthought in the software development lifecycle. Today, it stands as a pivotal phase in the development process, integral to ensuring the delivery of high-quality software products. The integration of methodologies like Agile and DevOps has revolutionized testing by embedding it into every stage of development, promoting a 'test early and often' philosophy. This shift not only enhances product quality but also reduces the time and cost associated with late-stage error corrections. )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [6]
